sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Cluster Admin
    participant CLI as oc adm must-gather<br/>(OCP) / kubectl apply Job (xKS)
    participant Pod as must-gather Pod
    participant Gather as gather.sh
    participant Detect as detect_k8s_distro
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant FS as /must-gather<br/>Local Filesystem

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over Admin,FS: Flow 1: OpenShift Must-Gather Collection (all components)
        Admin->>CLI: Invoke with --image=must-gather
        CLI->>Pod: Create pod with cluster-admin SA
        Pod->>Gather: Execute entrypoint
        Gather->>Detect: Check Kubernetes distribution
        Detect-->>Gather: OCP detected

        par 14 Component Collectors (parallel)
            Gather->>K8sAPI: gather_serving.sh<br/>GET InferenceServices, ServingRuntimes
            Gather->>K8sAPI: gather_data_science_pipelines.sh<br/>GET DSPApplications, Workflows
            Gather->>K8sAPI: gather_notebooks.sh<br/>GET Notebooks, ImageStreams
            Gather->>K8sAPI: gather_dashboard.sh<br/>GET OdhDashboardConfigs
            Gather->>K8sAPI: gather_kuberay.sh<br/>GET RayClusters, RayJobs
            Gather->>K8sAPI: gather_kueue.sh<br/>GET ClusterQueues, Workloads
            Gather->>K8sAPI: gather_kfto.sh<br/>GET PyTorchJobs, TrainJobs
            Gather->>K8sAPI: gather_mr.sh<br/>GET ModelRegistries
            Gather->>K8sAPI: gather_trustyai.sh<br/>GET LMEvalJobs, TrustyAIServices
            Gather->>K8sAPI: gather_feastoperator.sh<br/>GET FeatureStores
            Gather->>K8sAPI: gather_lls.sh<br/>GET LlamaStackDistributions
            Gather->>K8sAPI: gather_mlflow.sh<br/>GET MLflows
            Gather->>K8sAPI: gather_sparkoperator.sh<br/>GET SparkApplications
            Gather->>K8sAPI: gather_aigateway.sh<br/>GET AITenants, ExternalModels
            Note right of K8sAPI: Each collector discovers namespaces<br/>then calls oc adm inspect
        end

        Gather->>K8sAPI: oc adm inspect<br/>GET DSCInitialization, DataScienceCluster
        Gather->>K8sAPI: helm get values rhoai<br/>GET Helm release config
        K8sAPI-->>Gather: Resource data
        Gather->>FS: Write collected resources
        CLI-->>Admin: tar archive of /must-gather
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 230)
        Note over Admin,FS: Flow 2: xKS LLM-D Collection (Kubernetes Job)
        Admin->>CLI: kubectl apply -f must-gather-job.yaml
        CLI->>Pod: Create Job with must-gather-sa
        Pod->>Gather: Execute entrypoint
        Gather->>Detect: Check Kubernetes distribution
        Detect-->>Gather: CKS/AKS/EKS detected

        Gather->>K8sAPI: gather_cluster.sh<br/>GET nodes, API resources
        K8sAPI-->>Gather: Cluster info

        par Dependency Collectors (parallel)
            Gather->>K8sAPI: cert-manager.sh<br/>GET Certificates, Issuers
            Gather->>K8sAPI: sail.sh<br/>GET Istio, VirtualServices
            Gather->>K8sAPI: lws.sh<br/>GET LeaderWorkerSets
        end

        Gather->>K8sAPI: gather_llmd.sh<br/>kubectl_inspect per LLMInferenceService NS
        K8sAPI-->>Gather: LLM-D resources + pod logs

        opt Optional Sub-collectors
            Gather->>K8sAPI: gather_o11y.sh<br/>GET ServiceMonitors, PrometheusRules
            Gather->>K8sAPI: gather_wva.sh<br/>GET ScaledObjects, TriggerAuthentications
            Gather->>K8sAPI: gather_batch_gateway.sh<br/>Namespace inspection + Helm values
        end

        Gather->>FS: Write collected resources
        Admin->>Pod: kubectl cp must-gather data
        Pod-->>Admin: tar archive
    end
